Copyright (c) 2026 Daylight. All rights reserved.

DaylightUI is free to download and play with. The source is public so
people can read it, report problems and help improve it.

What you may do:
- Use DaylightUI in the game.
- Fork this repository on GitHub and change your fork to prepare pull
  requests back to it.
- Make plugins and profile packs (see below).

What you may not do without written permission from the author:
- Redistribute, re-upload or publish DaylightUI or any part of it (code,
  art or layouts), changed or not, anywhere other than a pull request to
  this repository.
- Reuse its code, art or layouts in another addon or project.

Contributions: by sending a pull request, patch or other contribution,
you confirm it is your own work (or you have the right to send it), and
you give the author a perpetual, worldwide, royalty-free, irrevocable
license to use, change, relicense and distribute it as part of DaylightUI
or otherwise.

Plugins and profile packs are welcome, no permission needed: you may
make, share and upload your own addons that run on top of DaylightUI,
use its functions, and add to or change how it looks and works in game,
and you may share profiles you made with it. Your addon is your own work
under your own license. It must not include copies of DaylightUI's code
or art (except the logo, below), and needs DaylightUI installed to run.

The logo: a plugin or profile pack may use the DaylightUI logo in its own
icon, banner or art if you add to it or change it to make it your own
(for example your plugin's name, your own art or colors on it). You may
not use the exact, unchanged logo image.

Exceptions: the bundled fonts (Media/fonts) and libraries (Libs) keep
their own licenses, listed with each of them.
